# Only the two notes, the side note and their own files are published. The datasheets, application notes and papers, the vendor
# SPICE models (except the four ADI files of the balanced-photodiode note), the SPICE runs, the working copies of the
# notes and the study of a high-voltage output stage in the high-gain folder stay local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.nojekyll
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/index.html
!/build/
!/pcbcap/
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/
!/TIA_feedback_layouts/

# The field-solver package: its outputs (examples write to results/) stay local
/pcbcap/results/
/pcbcap/*.egg-info/

# The balanced-photodiode note
/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/*
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/TIA_opamp_survey.md
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/TIA_opamp_survey.pdf
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/index.html
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/figures/
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/data/
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/scripts_archive/
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/

/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/data/results_test/
/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/data/digitization_checks/*.png

# Three-dimensional views of the layouts: the interactive pages, their small previews and plotly.min.js
# are published; the 600-dpi sheets that render_layout_views.py also writes stay local.
/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/figures/layout_views/*.pdf
/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/figures/layout_views/*.png
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/figures/layout_views/*_small.png

/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/*
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/results/
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/
/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/*
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/README.md
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/AD8099/
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/ADA4817-1/
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/ADA4895-1/
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/ADA4899-1/
/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/AD8099/*
/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/ADA4817-1/*
/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/ADA4895-1/*
/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/ADA4899-1/*
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/AD8099/ad8099.cir
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/ADA4817-1/ada4817.cir
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/ADA4895-1/ADA4895.cir
!/TIA_opamp_survey_2026-10-25/spice/models/ADA4899-1/ada4899.cir

# The high-gain note
/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/*
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/TIA_high_gain_survey.md
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/TIA_high_gain_survey.pdf
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/index.html
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/parts/
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/figures/
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/data/
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/scripts_archive/
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/spice/

/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/spice/*
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/spice/results/
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/spice/models/
/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/spice/models/*
!/TIA_high_gain_survey_2026-11-02/spice/models/README.md

__pycache__/
*.pyc
